    "directions": [
      "Take chicken breast, slit the chicken and lightly beat it with the back of your knife or a rolling pin.",
      "Stuff it with chicken ham and grated cheese, close it and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In another bowl, add refined flour, eggs, salt and pepper, beat it well into a thick batter. In another bowl, add bread crumbs.",
      "Heat oil and butter in a pan, coat the chicken with batter and bread crumbs, drop them in the pan and roast on a medium flame till chicken is cooked through.",
      "While chicken is cooking, heat oil and butter in another pan, add onion, green beans, salt, chilli flakes and stock, sautÃ© for a minute.",
      "Serve hot in a plate and garnish with parsley sprig."
